EnglishAdvancedLesson(level:'A2',number:8,unitNumber:1,title:"Returning a Purchase",titleArabic:"إرجاع منتج",storyTitle:"Returning a Purchase",storyTitleArabic:"إرجاع منتج",paragraphs:<String>["Daniel bought a desk lamp at a home store on Saturday. When he opened the package, he discovered that the switch did not work. He read the return policy and learned that damaged products could be returned within fourteen days.","Daniel went back to the store and described the fault to a sales assistant. He asked politely for a replacement instead of a refund. She tested the lamp and apologized for the inconvenience. Then she brought another lamp in a different color.","Daniel checked the replacement before leaving. He was glad that the issue had been solved calmly. That evening, he placed the working lamp beside his computer. He also decided to keep proof of purchase after every expensive purchase."],storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("desk lamp","مصباح مكتب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("package","علبة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("switch","مفتاح تشغيل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("fourteen days","أربعة عشر يومًا"),EnglishAdvancedWord("return policy","سياسة الإرجاع"),EnglishAdvancedWord("damaged products","منتجات تالفة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("fault","عطل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sales assistant","موظف مبيعات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("replacement","بديل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("refund","استرداد مال")],extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("warranty card","بطاقة ضمان"),EnglishAdvancedWord("store credit","رصيد متجر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("original packaging","علبة أصلية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("payment method","طريقة دفع"),EnglishAdvancedWord("proof of purchase","إثبات شراء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("customer rights","حقوق المستهلك"),EnglishAdvancedWord("product manual","دليل المنتج"),EnglishAdvancedWord("exchange counter","قسم الاستبدال"),EnglishAdvancedWord("manufacturer","جهة تصنيع"),EnglishAdvancedWord("model number","رقم الطراز"),EnglishAdvancedWord("quality check","فحص جودة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("order confirmation","تأكيد الطلب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("transaction date","تاريخ المعاملة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("price label","بطاقة السعر")],grammarTitle:"Polite requests: could and would",grammarArabic:"للطلب المهذب نقول Could I ...? أو Would it be possible to ...? وبعد Would you mind نستخدم صيغة ing، مثل Would you mind checking this?",grammarExamples:<String>["Could I exchange this lamp, please?","Would it be possible to get a refund?","Would you mind checking the switch?"],listening:"Thank you for contacting our customer service desk. If an item is faulty, please return it within fourteen days and bring proof of purchase. Our staff will examine the product and advise whether a repair, refund or replacement is possible. Items returned because you changed your mind must be unused and in their original packaging.",listeningQuestion:"What is needed when returning a faulty product?",listeningOptions:<String>["Proof of purchase","A photograph of a friend","A new bag"],listeningAnswer:0,readingQuestion:"What did Daniel ask for?",readingOptions:<String>["A replacement lamp","A second computer","A new desk"],readingAnswer:0,writingCue:"Daniel asked for a ____ because his lamp did not work.",writingAnswer:"replacement"),
EnglishAdvancedLesson(level:'A2',number:9,unitNumber:1,title:"The Weekend Hike",titleArabic:"رحلة المشي الأسبوعية",storyTitle:"The Weekend Hike",storyTitleArabic:"رحلة المشي الأسبوعية",paragraphs:<String>["Emma and her cousins planned a weekend hike on a forest trail. They packed water, snacks and a first-aid kit. Before leaving, they checked the weather forecast. A wooden sign marked the start of the walk, and a guidebook helped them choose the safest route.","After one hour they reached a steep hill. One cousin suggested a shortcut, but the others preferred the marked path. They stopped at a viewpoint and admired the valley. A park ranger asked the visitors to respect the plants and animals.","The group returned before sunset, tired but pleased. Emma wrote about the journey in her travel journal and shared a photograph. She decided that her next hike could be longer, but she would prepare carefully and check the route first."],storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("hike","رحلة مشي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("forest trail","مسار غابي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("first-aid kit","حقيبة إسعاف"),EnglishAdvancedWord("weather forecast","توقع الطقس"),EnglishAdvancedWord("wooden sign","لافتة خشبية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("guidebook","دليل سياحي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("steep hill","تل شديد الانحدار"),EnglishAdvancedWord("shortcut","طريق مختصر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("viewpoint","مطل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("park ranger","حارس محمية")],extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("walking boots","حذاء للمشي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("rain jacket","سترة مطر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("water bottle","قارورة ماء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("mountain path","مسار جبلي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("trail marker","علامة مسار"),EnglishAdvancedWord("rest stop","محطة استراحة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("wildlife","حياة برية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("binoculars","منظار"),EnglishAdvancedWord("compass","بوصلة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("map reading","قراءة خريطة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sunscreen","واقٍ شمسي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("travel journal","مذكرات سفر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("emergency whistle","صفارة طوارئ"),EnglishAdvancedWord("nature reserve","محمية طبيعية")],grammarTitle:"Ordering events with before, after and when",grammarArabic:"نستخدم before وafter وwhen لترتيب أحداث قصة. في جملة زمنية مستقبلية نستخدم المضارع بعد when، مثل We will rest when we reach the hill.",grammarExamples:<String>["Before we left, we checked the forecast.","After we reached the hill, we rested.","We will stop when we find a safe place."],listening:"Welcome to Green Valley Park. The northern trail is open this weekend, but some stones may be slippery after rain. Wear suitable shoes and carry enough drinking water. Stay on marked paths and avoid the narrow bridge near the river. The visitor center closes at five. All hikers should return before sunset.",listeningQuestion:"Which location should hikers avoid?",listeningOptions:<String>["The narrow bridge","The visitor center","The park entrance"],listeningAnswer:0,readingQuestion:"Why did the group avoid the shortcut?",readingOptions:<String>["They followed the marked path","They wanted to visit the shops","They forgot their lunch"],readingAnswer:0,writingCue:"A ____ reminded visitors to respect animals.",writingAnswer:"park ranger"),
EnglishAdvancedLesson(level:'A2',number:10,unitNumber:1,title:"The Community Sports Day",titleArabic:"اليوم الرياضي المجتمعي",storyTitle:"The Community Sports Day",storyTitleArabic:"اليوم الرياضي المجتمعي",paragraphs:<String>["The neighborhood held a sports day at the local field. Families entered a relay race, a friendly football match and a jumping contest. Sara volunteered to explain the rules to the children. She checked the equipment and placed water near the field.","During the relay race, the fastest runners dropped their baton on the final lap. They lost the race, but the crowd encouraged them. Later, a player helped an injured opponent, and everyone cheered for that act of sportsmanship.","At the end of the day, the organizers gave medals to the players and thanked the helpers. Sara realized that cooperation was better than winning a trophy. She promised to join the team again next year and invite more children."],storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("sports day","يوم رياضي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("local field","ملعب محلي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("relay race","سباق تتابع"),EnglishAdvancedWord("football match","مباراة كرة قدم"),EnglishAdvancedWord("jumping contest","مسابقة قفز"),EnglishAdvancedWord("equipment","معدات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("runners","عداؤون"),EnglishAdvancedWord("baton","عصا التتابع"),EnglishAdvancedWord("final lap","لفة أخيرة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sportsmanship","روح رياضية")],extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("scoreboard","لوحة النتائج"),EnglishAdvancedWord("referee","حكم"),EnglishAdvancedWord("team captain","قائد الفريق"),EnglishAdvancedWord("warm-up","إحماء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("stretching","تمارين إطالة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("finish line","خط النهاية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("participation medal","ميدالية مشاركة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("fair play","لعب نظيف"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sports committee","لجنة رياضية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("registration form","استمارة تسجيل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("training session","جلسة تدريب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("athletic shoes","حذاء رياضي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("goalkeeper","حارس مرمى"),EnglishAdvancedWord("cheering section","مدرج التشجيع")],grammarTitle:"Comparatives and superlatives",grammarArabic:"للمقارنة بين شيئين نقول faster than. وللمقارنة بين ثلاثة فأكثر نقول the fastest، أو the most exciting مع الصفات الطويلة.",grammarExamples:<String>["Sara was the youngest volunteer.","This was the most exciting match.","Our runners were faster than last year."],listening:"The relay race will begin in ten minutes at the east end of the field. All team captains should collect their numbers from the registration desk. The football final will follow a short break. Medals will be presented at four. Parents should keep the running track clear while children are competing. Remember that fair play is more important than winning.",listeningQuestion:"Where must team captains collect their numbers?",listeningOptions:<String>["At registration","At the football goal","From the audience"],listeningAnswer:0,readingQuestion:"What did Sara value most?",readingOptions:<String>["Working together","The biggest trophy","A perfect score"],readingAnswer:0,writingCue:"The fastest runners dropped their ____.",writingAnswer:"baton"),
];}
